                <l xml:id="m-2d0e0081-9b1f-4345-933c-bfbdb522356a" facs="#m-4bb88f4d-5e67-42d5-b9da-2f49ef29c797" label="text-like">sunday at Compline.</l><l xml:id="m-f2d4f94c-0a12-46e9-8b8f-ce306d5465a5" facs="#m-e4f79903-bbc5-430d-81be-aa242412ad50" label="ambiguous">263</l><l xml:id="m-17dea5b7-3387-4f2b-a80f-ff7c0f633954" facs="#m-e813e89f-c2be-4549-bf56-2339222f957e" label="lyrics-like">Pâter nóster. altogether in silence.</l><l xml:id="m-eb289f29-80fa-46ed-bfac-13b819ed4c2e" facs="#m-a51208e7-752e-4961-a0e3-d0bf621935b0" label="text-like">Then the Officiant says the Confiteor entirely recto tono, in a low voice.</l><l xml:id="m-1b7f091c-e894-4b76-916b-f8f4f47afa0b" facs="#m-f4f4353b-f114-485a-90e9-a0c5f4adcfc6" label="text-like">The Choir replies:</l><l xml:id="m-dbc99abd-864b-4060-a073-eaff433eb9ef" facs="#m-278a4b37-5d1d-418a-93b1-b06d3256298f" label="lyrics-like">Msereátur tui omnipotens Déus, et dimíssis peccátis túis, perdúcat</l><l xml:id="m-505a5e62-de5c-40a9-8fba-5a867078a770" facs="#m-af1ec83c-94ad-41e7-a3ff-0c2fd92bfd54" label="lyrics-like">34L te ad vitam aetérnam. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-eb3ffd8d-7358-44e1-88b1-49bf086c6133" facs="#m-bf8aa65a-8b8f-46d8-8c39-e9b1924a1238" label="text-like">Then the Choir says the Confiteor as follors:</l><l xml:id="m-c912068a-3bca-4727-9687-f50a970092fb" facs="#m-2ce250db-05db-4d94-a207-3b1c78e01dc4" label="lyrics-like">VOnfiteor Déo omnipoténti, beátae Maríae semper Virgini, beáto</l><l xml:id="m-c0c25f24-f6e5-45fe-9e21-d2235af37a91" facs="#m-8dd7721e-4959-4ff0-a693-b1b758dd8b95" label="lyrics-like">L Michaéli Archángelo, beâto Joanni Baptistae, sánctis Apóstolis Pétro</l><l xml:id="m-fc6bf8f5-32ee-467d-bf83-128aeb29fbbf" facs="#m-c288eb0d-fea7-4992-9bf4-ea006b604248" label="lyrics-like">et Páulo, ómnibus Sánctis, et tibi páter, quia peccávi nimis, cogita¬</l><l xml:id="m-179f44c9-7e2d-4c57-b40d-88ab42de259f" facs="#m-942df468-fdd8-4f1b-b2c6-9fe3b9c0717b" label="lyrics-like">tióne, vérbo et ópere: méa cúlpa, méa cúlpa, méa máxima cûlpa.</l><l xml:id="m-5f539b5d-984c-4419-aa44-50b1a2b3ad24" facs="#m-ad5c5f7c-8e45-44b5-8119-d6c6b6be2c1d" label="lyrics-like">Ideo précor beátam Mariam semper Virginem, beátum Michaélem</l><l xml:id="m-18c43cb0-ad02-4157-b666-d1dace20caa2" facs="#m-c16ec0c4-a6ea-4080-9baf-57b14e0a415e" label="lyrics-like">Archángelum, beátum Joánnem Baptistam, sánctos Apóstolos Pétrum</l><l xml:id="m-13c9abae-957c-463c-bcd8-ee7c55d20e03" facs="#m-b4238445-ae5e-476c-bc92-f5799851a576" label="lyrics-like">et Páulum, ómnes Sánctos, et te pá̂ter, oráre pro me ad Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-a124d73b-3120-4b51-925e-0027dd3da7c2" facs="#m-d1258aec-f485-4d99-bc68-54e76f93e6fc" label="lyrics-like">Déum nóstrum.</l><l xml:id="m-6bcb4c6e-ac0f-49c9-9599-b9794a8955f8" facs="#m-d9983b06-c8e0-4bff-911a-47d781c9539b" label="text-like">The Oficiant next says:</l><l xml:id="m-0ea456b1-8ff4-43e4-b3eb-4096ca2197af" facs="#m-1eb21f04-6baa-44dc-8daf-125b1d51ae81" label="lyrics-like">Msereátur véstri omnípotens Déus, et dimissis peccátis véstris,</l><l xml:id="m-5d6ab3c4-f2e4-4af3-91f6-24791531faa9" facs="#m-62c647c7-f465-4bf0-930a-f11e32b50217" label="lyrics-like">1L perdúcat vos ad vitam aetérnam. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-cc7a8391-243d-4939-bb69-bcd039b86223" facs="#m-8978a92e-cd43-4a88-b640-3a1433c41304" label="lyrics-like">Ndulgéntiam, absolutiónem, et remissiónem peccatórum nostrórum</l><l xml:id="m-4ef8c8fa-2c03-48e0-9ad6-7c98747b8bc9" facs="#m-3e75568b-9f0e-4a97-8330-5aee347730e6" label="lyrics-like">I tribuat nóbis omnipotens et miséricors Dóminus. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-ca487eea-912a-48b3-b271-4da305fea90d" facs="#m-730f3349-9885-4856-9c66-390a99cfd760" label="text-like">In nuns' choirs, the Confiteor. is said as indicated on p. 232.</l><l xml:id="m-4ab9ae1a-ad02-4c59-8b33-aa6ddb27c3db" facs="#m-0c812f29-b05a-47dd-a4c6-9056dd7a046d" label="text-like">The Officiant then sings:</l><l xml:id="m-7c32d421-942d-435a-95ff-dfa7fe1b4ee2" facs="#m-619769bb-e778-4979-ad56-b8b6ec66c172" label="lyrics-like">V. Convérte nos Dé-us sa lu-tá-ris nóster.</l><l xml:id="m-257b3c29-6603-46d0-bc2c-db51ced804d0" facs="#m-74c9a0fe-9eae-4696-86d6-fb2d634d92b3" label="lyrics-like">W. Et avérte i-ram tú-am a nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-a4efcf64-f6dc-4e11-a174-34eee58884c0" facs="#m-0a7dff93-d8b3-4d33-a4ed-b3a8cab0f448" label="ambiguous">Ferial Tone.</l><l xml:id="m-ca2927e6-6f80-4bb4-a45d-153cc37b64ad" facs="#m-bebc91ce-5a2c-475b-867e-1d5455a35908" label="ambiguous">Y.</l><l xml:id="m-b7ba457f-7fcc-4d9c-b0ba-303d357817dd" facs="#m-77f5f0a5-89c9-44fe-8b03-952dc2985247" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-bd5ad2f9-7e9f-4cc3-b4b0-68302bf114ac" facs="#m-1c8f5f3f-6def-4e7f-a002-126f5de855b7" label="lyrics-like">E-us in adju-tó-ri-um mé-um inténde. K. Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b04fd453-c41d-4049-8a26-92fe9965cde2" facs="#m-f07a983e-4439-4a1e-9f7b-1f0fade37f86" label="lyrics-like">ne ad adjuvándum me festína. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee907209-4b7c-4a87-af16-26649e96e991" facs="#m-3e871f05-77ad-478d-9336-48dd9229d439" label="lyrics-like">li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto. Sic-ut é-rat in princi-pi-o, et</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>